[2C[3A[2D[3B[7A[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39mAn Electron app is a cross-platform desktop application built[65Gusing[71Gweb[75Gtechnologies[88G—[90GHTML,[96GCSS,[101Gand[105GJavaScript/TypeScript[127G—[129Gthat[134Gruns[139Gas[142Ga[144Gnative-feeling[159Gprogram[167Gon[170GWindows,[179GmacOS,[186Gand[190GLinux.[197GIt[200Gbundles[1B  together two big pieces: a Chromium browser engine for rendering your UI, and a Node.js[91Gruntime[99Gfor[103Gsystem[110Gaccess.[118GTogether[127Gthey[132Glet[136Gyou[140Gwrite[146Gyour[151Ginterface[161Glike[166Ga[168Gwebsite[176Gwhile[182Gstill[188Gtouching[197Gthe[2C[1Bfilesystem,[15Gspawning[24Gprocesses,[35Gshowing[43GOS[46Gnotifications,[61Gand[65Gdoing[71Geverything[82Gelse[87Ga[89G"real"[96Gdesktop[104Gapp[108Gneeds.[1B[K[1B  Architecturally,[20Gevery[26GElectron[35Gapp[39Ghas[43Gtwo[47Gkinds[53Gof[56Gprocesses:[67Ga[69Gsingle[76G[1mmain process[89G[22mthat[94Gowns[99Gthe[103GOS-level[112Gconcerns[121G(windows,[131Gmenus,[138Gthe[142Gapp[146Glifecycle,[157GIPC,[162Gnative[169Gmodules)[178Gand[182Gone[186Gor[189Gmore[194G[1mrenderer [1B[22m  [1mprocesses[22m that each run a webpage in Chromium and host your UI. They talk to each other over Electron's IPC channels, with a tiny preload script exposing a curated [38;2;177;185;249mwindow.electronAPI[39m to the renderer so it can[2C[1B request privileged work without having unfettered Node access. Bodhilander is built[88Gthis[93Gway:[98G[38;2;177;185;249msrc/main/[108G[39mis[111Gthe[115Gprivileged[126Ghalf[131G(PTY,[137GSQLite,[145Gnative[152Gmodules),[162Gand[166G[38;2;177;185;249msrc/renderer/[180G[39mis[183Gthe[187GReact[193Gapp[197Gyou[201Gsee.

